2719
02:01:37.670 --> 02:01:39.610
Ryan's gotten very good at talking to camera

2720
02:01:39.610 --> 02:01:42.300
and offering advice and wisdom.

2721
02:01:42.300 --> 02:01:43.910
It's definitely a must follow.

2722
02:01:43.910 --> 02:01:45.593
So, find him on YouTube.

2723
02:01:46.470 --> 02:01:50.030
You can find him at The Daily Stoic also.

2724
02:01:50.030 --> 02:01:52.201
Yeah, dailystoic.com and @DailyStoic

2725
02:01:52.201 --> 02:01:53.760
is where it is everywhere.

2726
02:01:53.760 --> 02:01:57.640
Which is his robust community on all things Stoicism.

2727
02:01:57.640 --> 02:02:00.490
And of course, pick up the new book, "Courage Is Calling,"

2728
02:02:00.490 --> 02:02:01.860
available everywhere.

2729
