And of course, if you find yourself in Texas,

2730
02:02:05.070 --> 02:02:09.220
show up uninvited at The Painted Porch Bookstore.

2731
02:02:09.220 --> 02:02:10.520
And I'll pretend to be busy. (laughs)

2732
02:02:10.520 --> 02:02:13.381
And he may be available, but probably not.

2733
02:02:13.381 --> 02:02:14.320
All right.

2734
02:02:14.320 --> 02:02:15.153
Cool, man.

2735
02:02:15.153 --> 02:02:16.340
Thanks, dude.

2736
02:02:16.340 --> 02:02:17.462
Peace.

2737
